streamvbyte
------------------------------------------
StreamVByte is a new integer compression technique that applies SIMD
instructions (vectorization) to Google's Group Varint approach. The net result
is faster than other byte-oriented compression techniques.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libstreamvbyte-devel-3.0.1-1bl1
  libstreamvbyte3-3.0.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/fast-pack/streamvbyte

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/fast-pack/streamvbyte/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack streamvbyte-3.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./streamvbyte-3.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/streamvbyte-3.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/streamvbyte-3.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libstreamvbyte3-3.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libstreamvbyte-devel-3.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(streamvbyte)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/streamvbyte.README
  /usr/share/doc/streamvbyte/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/streamvbyte/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/streamvbyte/README.md

(libstreamvbyte3)
  /usr/bin/cygstreamvbyte-3.dll

(libstreamvbyte-devel)
  /usr/include/streamvbyte.h
  /usr/include/streamvbyte_zigzag.h
  /usr/include/streamvbytedelta.h
  /usr/lib/libstreamvbyte.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/streamvbyte.pc

